      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/riverside-washington-ghost-town/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Riverside is one of only a few places worldwide where the mineral thulite is found, alongside locations in North Carolina, Norway, and New Zealand.",
